/// are returned. You can choose the time window that statistics should be
/// returned for. Hours - You can request utterance statistics for 1, 3, 6,
/// 12, or 24 hour time windows. Statistics are refreshed every half hour
/// for 1 hour time windows, and hourly for the other time windows. Days -
/// You can request utterance statistics for 3 days. Statistics are
/// refreshed every 6 hours. Weeks - You can see statistics for one or two
/// weeks. Statistics are refreshed every 12 hours for one week time
/// windows, and once per day for two week time windows.
